WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.520
This is your ship, correct?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.440
Oh, yeah!

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.008
That's my ship, it's my pride and joy.

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.000
The Invincible.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.240
I mean, it's our ship actually.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.800
This is the captain so&nbsp;
technically they are in charge.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:15.940
Oh!

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.727
You're in charge!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:20.580
So...

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.876
This ship is your responsibility.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.040
I swear...

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.200
If one more thing blows up on my ship

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.547
I'm gonna lose it!

00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:35.949
WOAH!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.400
Warning!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.204
Large object on collision course with ship.

00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:57.009
Brace for impact.

00:00:57.418 --> 00:00:58.876
It's up to the Captain!

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:01.963
They haven't let us down yet.

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.557
Captain! Something is very wrong-  

00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:06.376
But we seem to have this situation all under control.

00:01:07.195 --> 00:01:09.195
We have to fix this now or we're all gonna die!

00:01:09.195 --> 00:01:10.000
Captain?!

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.680
It all comes down-

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:12.720
The Captain wouldn't do that...

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.000
-to bad leadership.

00:01:14.361 --> 00:01:15.361
CAPTAIN!!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.160
Have you ever considered that&nbsp;
there is no right answer?

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.678
Have we been here before...?

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.240
Every mistake has cost the&nbsp;
lives of people who've trusted you!

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.400
Which means that if I'm&nbsp;
seeing it, I must be crazy!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.280
But I'm not crazy!

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.219
Everything has to end-

00:01:32.219 --> 00:01:37.040
I go and I come back and I go and&nbsp;
I come back and I ALWAYS COME BACK!

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.840
-and everything... has to begin.

00:01:46.387 --> 00:01:47.529
Ugh... Captain...

00:01:47.835 --> 00:01:48.960
I don't feel so-

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:49.460
HURGH!

00:01:52.563 --> 00:01:53.063
Ow.

